  "description": "A .NET 10 port of the Baileys WhatsApp Web library.\n      Provides the WABinary codec, crypto utilities, JID helpers, Noise protocol handler,\n      auth credential initialisation, complete WhatsApp type definitions, Signal-protocol\n      Signal-protocol key storage (ISignalKeyStore / InMemorySignalKeyStore / DirectorySignalKeyStore),\n      a full AuthenticationState bundle, and a DirectoryAuthStateProvider that mirrors\n      the TypeScript useMultiFileAuthState() integration pattern.",
